### Checkout form (opens the hosted checkout when posted by a browser)
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchant/pay?lang=en
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

merchantid={{merchantId}}&number={{orderNumber}}&amount={{amount}}&currency={{currency}}&description={{description}}&sign={{createSign}}

### Create order
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchant/payGate/createorder
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantid": "{{merchantId}}",
  "number": "{{orderNumber}}",
  "amount": "{{amount}}",
  "currency": "{{currency}}",
  "description": "{{description}}",
  "sign": "{{createSign}}"
}

### Check state
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchant/payGate/checkstate?merchant_id={{merchantId}}&order_number={{orderNumber}}&amount={{stateAmount}}&currency={{currency}}&sign={{stateSign}}
Accept: application/json

### Quote
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchant/payGate/paywayinfo?merchant_id={{merchantId}}&amount={{amount}}&currency={{currency}}&opt_payway={{payway}}&sign={{quoteSign}}
Accept: application/json

### Cancel order
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchant/payGate/cancel
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantId": "{{merchantId}}",
  "orderNumber": "{{orderNumber}}",
  "signature": "{{cancelSignature}}"
}

### Get crypto address
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchant/payGate/getorderadress
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantid": "{{merchantId}}",
  "amount": "{{amount}}",
  "number": "{{orderNumber}}",
  "cryptoCurrency": "{{cryptoCurrency}}"
}

### List all payment methods
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchant/payGate/payways?all=1
Accept: application/json

### List payment methods for this order
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchant/payGate/payways?merchantid={{merchantId}}&amount={{amount}}&currency={{currency}}
Accept: application/json

### Get currency rate
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchant/payGate/currencyrate?merchantid={{merchantId}}&amount={{amount}}&currency={{currency}}&opt_pc=BTC
Accept: application/json
